...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: "사용자" { class: person }
ui: "화면 (process_query)" { class: ours }
embed: "임베딩 모델 (fastembed, 로컬)" { class: ext }
openai: "OpenAI gpt-4o" { class: ext }
agents: "에이전트 (Runner)" { class: ours }
qdrant: "Qdrant" { class: store }

user -> ui: 질문 입력
ui -> user: st.status(\n"Processing your query...")
ui -> user: "🔄 Searching documentation\nand generating response..."
ui -> embed: embed(질문 글)
embed -> ui: 질문 벡터 (384차원)
ui -> qdrant: query_points(limit=3)
qdrant -> ui: 점 3건 (본문 · 주소)
ui -> agents: Runner.run(처리 에이전트,\n문서 3건 + 질문)
agents -> openai: POST /v1/responses\n(gpt-4o, 지시문 + 문서 3건)
openai -> agents: 답변 글
agents -> ui: processor_response
